{"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"article","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Getting Started"},"abstract":[{"text":"Setting up an Xcode project that uses MapLibre Native for iOS.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Create a new iOS project","type":"heading","anchor":"Create-a-new-iOS-project","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Create a new (SwiftUI) iOS project with Xcode. Go to ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"File > New > Project…","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Add MapLibre Native as a dependency","type":"heading","anchor":"Add-MapLibre-Native-as-a-dependency","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"MapLibre Native for iOS is available on ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/cocoapods.org","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and on the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/swiftpackageindex.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" (for use with the Swift Package Manager). However, for this guide we will add the MapLibre Native as a package dependency directly.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In Xcode, right click your project and select “Add Package Dependencies…”:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"AddPackageDependencies.png","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Paste the following URL and click Add Package:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution"],"syntax":null},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution","type":"reference"},{"text":" repository only exists for distributing the iOS package of MapLibre Native. To report issues and ask questions, use the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native","type":"reference"},{"text":" repository.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Verify you can import MapLibre in your app:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import MapLibre"],"syntax":"swift"},{"text":"SwiftUI","type":"heading","anchor":"SwiftUI","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To use MapLibre with SwiftUI we need to create a wrapper for the UIKit view that MapLibre provides (using UIViewRepresentable. The simplest way to implement this protocol is as follows:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct SimpleMap: UIViewRepresentable {","    func makeUIView(context _: Context) -> MLNMapView {","        let mapView = MLNMapView()","        return mapView","    }","","    func updateUIView(_: MLNMapView, context _: Context) {}","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can use this view directly in a SwiftUI View hierarchy, for example:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            SimpleMap().edgesIgnoringSafeArea(.all)","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When running your app in the simulator you should be greeted with the default ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/demotiles.maplibre.org\/","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" style:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"DemotilesScreenshot.png","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"UIKit","type":"heading","anchor":"UIKit","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can use the following ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIViewController"},{"text":" to get started with MapLibre Native iOS with UIKit.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["class SimpleMap: UIViewController, MLNMapViewDelegate {","    var mapView: MLNMapView!","","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","","        mapView = MLNMapView(frame: view.bounds)","        mapView.autoresizingMask = [.flexibleWidth, .flexibleHeight]","        view.addSubview(mapView)","","        mapView.delegate = self","    }","","    \/\/ MLNMapViewDelegate method called when map has finished loading","    func mapView(_: MLNMapView, didFinishLoading _: MLNStyle) {","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GettingStarted"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AddMarkerSymbolExample"],"title":"Essentials","generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/gettingstarted"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"]]},"references":{"https://cocoapods.org":{"titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Cocoapods","type":"text"}],"type":"link","title":"Cocoapods","url":"https:\/\/cocoapods.org","identifier":"https:\/\/cocoapods.org"},"https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native":{"titleInlineContent":[{"text":"maplibre-native","type":"text"}],"type":"link","title":"maplibre-native","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/AddMarkerSymbolExample":{"title":"Add Marker","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AddMarkerSymbolExample","type":"topic","kind":"article","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/addmarkersymbolexample","abstract":[{"text":"Simply add a marker to a map!","type":"text"}]},"https://swiftpackageindex.com/maplibre/maplibre-gl-native-distribution":{"titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Swift Package Index","type":"text"}],"type":"link","title":"Swift Package Index","url":"https:\/\/swiftpackageindex.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution","identifier":"https:\/\/swiftpackageindex.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution"},"https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-gl-native-distribution":{"titleInlineContent":[{"text":"maplibre-gl-native-distributon","type":"text"}],"type":"link","title":"maplibre-gl-native-distributon","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution"},"DemotilesScreenshot.png":{"alt":null,"type":"image","identifier":"DemotilesScreenshot.png","variants":[{"traits":["2x","light"],"url":"\/images\/org.swift.MyProject\/DemotilesScreenshot@2x.png"}]},"https://demotiles.maplibre.org/":{"titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Demotiles","type":"text"}],"type":"link","title":"Demotiles","url":"https:\/\/demotiles.maplibre.org\/","identifier":"https:\/\/demotiles.maplibre.org\/"},"AddPackageDependencies.png":{"alt":null,"type":"image","identifier":"AddPackageDependencies.png","variants":[{"traits":["2x","light"],"url":"\/images\/org.swift.MyProject\/AddPackageDependencies@2x.png"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"title":"MapLibre","type":"topic"}}}